          },
          "description": "This is a retelling of the tragic sinking of the Titanic, as told by 9 year old Misha (from memory and without a script)! Icon graphics are also illustrated by Misha, and he would like you to know that all the details are intentional -- track 4 is only the hull, the Titanic w/ steam is showing 3 of the 4 funnels as functional, and the icon for the discovery in 1985 is showing the rusty remains and Ballard's probe which made the discovery.\n\n*Mama's note: I'm currently fact-checking everything!",
